    content: "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n\nNCIT got appreciation award from WUSC at National chamber’s entrepreneur awarding ceremony 2018 for empowering entrepreneurship through its activities. NCIT chairman Mr.T.Thavaruban received it from country director of WUSC Ms.Esther on 13.11.2018 at Srilanka foundation Auditorium\n\n</p>",
