    title: "NCIT Talk session on Criteria of global Citizenry",
    excerpt: "NCIT Talk session was held on 29.10.2018 at NCIT Business Incubation Center Scientist Dr.Narayanan Kannan was delivered Talk in the title of “Criteria of g",
    content: "<p><span class=\"_5afx\"><span class=\"_58cm\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ncit-talk-session-criteria-global-citizenry-2018-01.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ncit-talk-session-criteria-global-citizenry-2018-01.jpg\" width=\"421\" height=\"316\" alt=\"NCIT Talk session on Criteria of global Citizenry\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>NCIT</span></span> Talk session was held on 29.10.2018 at NCIT <a href=\"/what-we-do/business-incubation-center\" class=\"text-ncit-blue underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline\">Business Incubation Center</a> Scientist Dr.Narayanan Kannan was delivered Talk in the title of “Criteria of global Citizenry”. He spent 2.30 hrs with youths and Professionals .It was great knowledge Sharing was through his experience in India ,Japan ,Germany, Malaysia,Korea ,Srilanka</p>\n<p>Dr.Narayanan Kannan is A professional environmental scientist and German national working as Adjunct Professor at AIMST University, malasiya; with over quarter century of international research experience in various aspects of Persistent Organic Pollutants (POPs) including the fate and transport, risk-assessment, degradation processes, human exposure pathways, biogeochemistry. Worked in Japan, Germany, Korea and India.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ncit-talk-session-criteria-global-citizenry-2018-02.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ncit-talk-session-criteria-global-citizenry-2018-02.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" alt=\"NCIT Talk session on Criteria of global Citizenry, photo 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ncit-talk-session-criteria-global-citizenry-2018-03.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/ncit-talk-session-criteria-global-citizenry-2018-03.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" alt=\"NCIT Talk session on Criteria of global Citizenry, photo 3\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>",
