    excerpt: "U.S. Embassy Colombo, Sri Lanka Deputy Chief of Mission Robert B. Northern Chamber of Information Technology, Jaffna.",
    content: "<p>U.S. Embassy Colombo, Sri Lanka Deputy Chief of Mission Robert B. Hilton learned about NCIT and Yarl IT hub efforts to build tech &amp; Entrepreneurship eco systems to support innovation in Northern Province. Chairman Thavaruban From NCIT and Ramesh from YarlITHub were participated.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-deputy-chief-mission-robert-b-hilton-2017-01.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-deputy-chief-mission-robert-b-hilton-2017-01.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"883\" alt=\"Meeting With Deputy Chief of Mission Robert B. Hilton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-deputy-chief-mission-robert-b-hilton-2017-02.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-deputy-chief-mission-robert-b-hilton-2017-02.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"760\" alt=\"Meeting With Deputy Chief of Mission Robert B. Hilton, photo 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p>Meeting were held on 01.08.2017 @ Jetwing Hotel Jaffna</p>",
