    slug: "infotel-2017",
    title: "INFOTEL 2017",
    excerpt: "The Federation of Information Technology Industry Sri Lanka (FITIS) had their flagship Infotel exhibition for the 25th successive year with many novel and ",
    content: "<p>The Federation of Information Technology Industry Sri Lanka (FITIS) had their flagship Infotel exhibition for the 25th successive year with many novel and innovative features at BMICH from Nov 2 – 5.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-infotel-2017-2017-01.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-infotel-2017-2017-01.jpg\" width=\"3968\" height=\"2976\" alt=\"INFOTEL 2017\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-ncit-blue underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline\">Northern Chamber of Information Technology</a> (NCIT) taking part in the exhibition for the first time, powered by FITIS and World University Service of Canada (WUSC) and in collaboration with Vavuniya Information &amp; Communication Association (ViCTA) and Mannar Federation of Information &amp; Communication Technology (ManFICT).</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-infotel-2017-2017-02.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-infotel-2017-2017-02.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" alt=\"INFOTEL 2017, photo 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-infotel-2017-2017-03.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-infotel-2017-2017-03.jpg\" width=\"3968\" height=\"2976\" alt=\"INFOTEL 2017, photo 3\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>",
