    slug: "business-digitalization-seminar-in-mannar",
    title: "Business Digitalization seminar in Mannar",
    excerpt: "NCIT supported the event which were organized by MANFICT in Mannar on 24th October.",
    content: "<p>NCIT supported the event which were organized by MANFICT in Mannar on 24th October. MANFIT is a association member which conducting a seminar for business people and ICT teachers to embower and uplift Mannar district business through digitizing all its operations to compete with the current business word .event sheduled with the collaborating with NCIT and WUSC.</p>\n<p>Event held at Hotel Akash on 24th October 2017 9AM to 3PM. Mannar District Government agent Mr.M.Y.S.Deshapriya was Chief guest</p>\n<p>Topics covered:<br>\n-Digital Tools and Service Opportunities available for Small Medium Enterprises.<br>\n-Tamil Software and Apps available for Small Medium Enterprises.<br>\n-How to enhance the Small Medium Enterprises through the Digital Marketing.<br>\n-How to transform the business to <span class=\"text_exposed_show\">E commerce platform</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-business-digitalization-seminar-mannar-2017-01.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-business-digitalization-seminar-mannar-2017-01.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" alt=\"Business Digitalization seminar in Mannar\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-business-digitalization-seminar-mannar-2017-02.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-business-digitalization-seminar-mannar-2017-02.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" alt=\"Business Digitalization seminar in Mannar, photo 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-business-digitalization-seminar-mannar-2017-03.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-business-digitalization-seminar-mannar-2017-03.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" alt=\"Business Digitalization seminar in Mannar, photo 3\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>",
