    id: "40",
    slug: "meeting-with-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon",
    title: "Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon",
    seoTitle: "Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner",
    excerpt: "NCIT had meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon and his team today 30.11.2017 at Valamuri hotel Jaffna.Meeting was arranged by WUSC.",
    content: "<p>NCIT had meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon and his team today 30.11.2017 at Valamuri hotel Jaffna.Meeting was arranged by WUSC. After take charge as HC in Srilanka ,Mr.David McKinnon visited to jaffna first time today and interested to know the activities lead by Chambers and forums where WUSC supported , He met all key officials of ICT , Constructions , Automobile,Tourism Associations along with WUSC regional team</p>\n<p>On behalf of NCIT, Chairman T.Thavaruban and Vice chairman Y.Sharmmhik were participated in the discussion and explained all about NCIT , its past activities and needs of ICT industry sectors here in Northern province.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-01.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-01.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1065\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-02.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-02.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-03.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-03.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 3\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p>T.Senthuran, R.Sivananthan, T.Yasotharan, Ms Jeyavani, Ms Helen were joined in WUSC team , and High commissioner David McKinnon, Counselor (Political &amp; Trade) Ms Jennifer Hart and Victoria Walker were in CHC team</p>\n<p>Finally on behalf of NCIT, chairman Thavaruban gave memorandum to David McKinnon</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-04.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-04.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-05.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-05.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"578\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 5\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-06.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-06.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 6\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-07.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-07.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 7\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a> <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-08.jpg\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ncit-meeting-canadian-high-commissioner-mr-david-mckinnon-2017-08.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Meeting with Canadian High Commissioner Mr.David McKinnon, photo 8\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>",
