    id: "53",
    slug: "youth-entrepreneurship-technical-advisory-forum",
    title: "YOUTH ENTREPRENEURSHIP TECHNICAL ADVISORY FORUM",
    seoTitle: "Youth Entrepreneurship Advisory Forum, Jaffna",
    excerpt: "There is growing interest in encouraging ‘Start Ups’ to create dynamic enterprises and economies all over the world.",
    content: "<p>There is growing interest in encouraging ‘Start Ups’ to create dynamic enterprises and economies all over the world. In the Northern Region of SL also, this has been felt and some pioneers have already started initial works in this aspect. HNB is Conducting a YOUTH ENTREPRENEURSHIP TECHNICAL ADVISORY FORUM on 6th October 3PM -6PM @ HNB Jaffna Auditorium.</p>\n<p>Do you have a Good idea? Are you thinking of turning the idea into a good or service that would solve a problem or ease our lives? Are you thinking of developing your idea into a business? Are you finding it difficult to get investors interested in your business idea? Then, We propose you to attend this forum.</p>\n<p>NCIT also giving Community Support for this event. Early Confirmation Required .If you interested to participate in this event Please register here: https://goo.gl/nTteGh</p>\n<p>Event FB: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/1580883228886016/\">https://www.facebook.com/events/1580883228886016/</a></p>\n",
